  "result": "CP20/B2 closes the locked no-x86 GPU execution boundary: the retained ELF and source-locked HSACO run through native queue admission, reused GPUDispatcher/Shader/ComputeUnit/Vega execution, full A/B/C output validation, packet retirement, MQD update, signal completion, and pin release with no runtime CPU object or fallback. Triton vecadd remains the next distinct end-to-end launcher gate.",
